<title>USA: Universal Health Services Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Universal Health Services Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>KING OF PRUSSIA, Pa. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>							Three months</p>
<p>						     ended March 31,</p>
<p>						 1997		    1996</p>
<p> Net revenues			  $340,170		$266,523</p>
<p> Net income				21,530		  15,501</p>
<p>Earnings per common and common</p>
<p>  equivalent share:			0.65		    0.54</p>
<p>Average number of common shares</p>
<p>  and equivalents:		     32,986		  28,712</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 includes a charge of $1 million to reduce the value of a building that it expects to sell.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
